    "desc": "## **Lore:**\n\n**“Welcome… to the “True Man’s World.”**\n\n**The Stand of Ringo Roadagain. By turning the dial on his wristwatch, Ringo can rewind time by exactly six seconds. He uses this ability to correct his errors and achieve perfection in a duel.**\n\n---\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43549a0e096062fb7b5aa/attachments/6ab5304a204fb5786a92686d/previews/6ab5304a204fb5786a926910/download/image.webp)\n\n## Pose:\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43549a0e096062fb7b5aa/attachments/6ae11bf13c164ad1f32b57d9/previews/6ae11bf13c164ad1f32b5a94/download/image.webp)\n\n---\n\n## Two rewind timings\n\n**Rewind instantly or schedule a rewind with Watch Set.**\n\n## M1 Light Combo & M2 Attack\n\n![m1m1m1m1m1m1m11mmmm.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43549a0e096062fb7b5aa/attachments/6ab54d5e240678fc9566f742/previews/6ab54d63240678fc9566fc79/download/m1m1m1m1m1m1m11mmmm.gif)\n\n## Rewind\n\n**Turn back time by 6 seconds, restoring your previous position and health.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 45s**\n\n![Rewind.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43549a0e096062fb7b5aa/attachments/6ab530fb80737a92b57716b8/previews/6ab5310180737a92b5771e55/download/Rewind.gif)\n\n## Ol' Reliable [BASIC ATTACK]\n\n**Fire a trusty revolver shot at your target.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 28s**\n\n## First Usage:\n\n![gun.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43549a0e096062fb7b5aa/attachments/6ab5317e4df801da12a833ca/previews/6ab531824df801da12a83781/download/gun.gif)\n\n## Basic Attack:\n\n![gunshoot.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43549a0e096062fb7b5aa/attachments/6ab531c9f9bf00abbb76142e/previews/6ab531d1f9bf00abbb761ba7/download/gunshoot.gif)\n\n## Deadeye\n\n**Take careful aim and fire a powerful shot.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 35s**\n\n![deadeye.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43549a0e096062fb7b5aa/attachments/6ab5322530e24f6ffeaf65c1/previews/6ab5322b30e24f6ffeaf6a82/download/deadeye.gif)\n\n## Watch Set\n\n**Start a countdown that automatically rewinds you and nearby targets.**\n\n**Once the watch is set, you can move and fight while the countdown runs. The rewind happens automatically when time runs out.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 70s**\n\n![rewindwatch.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43549a0e096062fb7b5aa/attachments/6ab532bc372b5130944e8a9e/previews/6ab532d2372b5130944ea9bc/download/rewindwatch.gif)\n\n---\n\n## EX Moveset\n\n# TRUE MAN’S WORLD (5 Bars)\n\n**Spend a full EX gauge to rewind after a lethal hit during the next 30 seconds. Use while bleeding out to rewind immediately. Nearby opponents rewind with you.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 90s**",
